        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/e28e66612395350e9a249f92ae18e329.poster.avif?t=1758507028\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/e28e66612395350e9a249f92ae18e329.webm?t=1758507028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/e28e66612395350e9a249f92ae18e329.mp4?t=1758507028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>The Grim Gamble</i> is a first-person, local multiplayer board game for 1 to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Outsmart your opponents, read their intentions, and rely on a bit of luck to survive a deadly game of life and death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/2e2b372ccaefdf360e931488155dc878.poster.avif?t=1758507028\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/2e2b372ccaefdf360e931488155dc878.webm?t=1758507028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/2e2b372ccaefdf360e931488155dc878.mp4?t=1758507028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As darkness falls, four chosen gamblers gather in a shadowy arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The air is thick with decadence, pleasure—and madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The moment you sit at the table, your wrists are locked into cold steel restraints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Running down the center is the grotesque <i>Saw Train</i>, a mechanical executioner that demands a “payment” from the loser—by severing their hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > All you have are your wits, your instincts, and a dash of luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This is a card battle where your life is on the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > “Welcome to <i>The Grim Gamble</i>.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Rule<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/b36fd5a93325682ae7e1916432769fea.poster.avif?t=1758507028\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/b36fd5a93325682ae7e1916432769fea.webm?t=1758507028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/b36fd5a93325682ae7e1916432769fea.mp4?t=1758507028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to Play – “MAX OUT”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each player is dealt one card—but you can’t see your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Instead, you must observe everyone else’s cards and guess:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > “What’s the total value of all the cards?”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Catch the lies, push the limit, and say the highest number you can without going over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You only get three chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Lose three games, and it’s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/459a99d8e7a447d76409261ad6bb2cf0.poster.avif?t=1758507028\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/459a99d8e7a447d76409261ad6bb2cf0.webm?t=1758507028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/459a99d8e7a447d76409261ad6bb2cf0.mp4?t=1758507028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to Play – “FULL BODY”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player is dealt 4 cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three types of cards: Head, Arms, and Legs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take turns playing one card at a time until a total of 8 cards are stacked in the center.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first card you play is placed face up; the second card is placed face down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards are then revealed from the top of the stack one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player who exactly completes a Full Body—1 Head, 2 Arms, and 2 Legs—wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After seeing the first face-up card, try to complete the Full Body on your turn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/553f71f5150476238253d4cbc514fd38.poster.avif?t=1758507028\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/553f71f5150476238253d4cbc514fd38.webm?t=1758507028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739360/extras/553f71f5150476238253d4cbc514fd38.mp4?t=1758507028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The average play time for this game is between 10 and 30 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permission to Stream: Streaming is allowed without any prior permission for both individuals and organizations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization: Monetization is allowed only if the platform's features are used. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disclaimer: We take no responsibility for any damages resulting from streaming videos of this game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Possible Changes: These guidelines are subject to change without notice.</p>",
